{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32370","headline":"咏寒宵 · 温庭筠","name":"咏寒宵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒宵何耿耿，良讌有余姿。\n宝靺徘徊处，熏鑪怅望时。\n曲琼垂翡翠，斜月到罘罳。\n委坠金釭烬，阑珊玉局棊。\n话穷犹注睇，歌罢尚持颐。\n晻暖遥相属，氛氲积所思。\n秦蛾卷衣晚，胡雁度云迟。\n上郡归来梦，那知锦字诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}